# Pharmacy lot management (accepted)

Product card ≠ lot. `store_stock` is a **projection** of movements — never a free-edit field from the product modal.

## Entities

| Layer | Owns | Does not own |
|---|---|---|
| Product card | Nomenclature, catalog prices/attrs | Per-delivery qty / batch / expiry |
| Lot (`StockLot`) | Batch, expiry, qty linked to source line | Direct UI overwrite without op |
| Source doc | RECEIPT / OPENING line → creates/syncs lot | Fake receipts for qty fixes |
| Inventory | Fact vs book qty (ADJUSTMENT path) | Supplier delivery story |

## Stock change rule (hard)

Any change to available stock goes through a warehouse operation:

- `RECEIPT` — supplier intake (POSTED line ↔ lot sync)
- `OPENING` — cutover / initial balances (not a normal supply)
- `SALE` / `RETURN`
- `ADJUSTMENT` — inventory / explicit lot correction (audited)
- `TRANSFER` — store-to-store

**Must NOT:** `UPDATE store_stock` or lot qty from product card save; invent a RECEIPT only to tweak qty.

## Lot edit = operation + audit

Lot UI actions are separate ops, not silent DB edits:

- Change batch / expiry (metadata op + audit old→new, user, time, reason)
- Qty correction → **ADJUSTMENT movement** (not overwrite); respect sold/reserved
- Cost change → audited; may sync product cost when policy says so

Prefer derived quantities over blind overwrite:

- initial/received qty (from source doc)
- sold / reserved (from sales)
- adjustments (from ADJUSTMENT ops)
- **available** = f(received, sold, reserved, adjustments)

If sold already happened, lowering “received” below sold must fail or force explicit ADJUSTMENT — never silent clamp of available.

## Source provenance

Keep lot origin visible forever:

- `sourceType`: RECEIPT | OPENING | …
- `sourceDocument` id/number
- product, batch, expiry, initial qty, current qty

Do not erase history when editing batch/expiry/qty.

## Product card UX (target)

- Header: name, active, **total stock**, **lot count**
- Section **Складские партии**: list lots (batch, source badge, expiry, available) + ⋯ ops
- Section **История**: receipts, sales, inventory, adjustments, returns, transfers
- Deep-link to source receipt when `receiptLine` exists

## OPENING vs RECEIPT

- OPENING = cutover / “просто на склад”, own UX + import path
- Do not mix OPENING rows into “поставка от поставщика” mental model
- After OPENING posted, further qty fixes → inventory/ADJUSTMENT, not another fake supply

## Delivery order (do not skip)

1. POSTED → lot sync (all line fields) — critical ✅  
2. OPENING UX + import — high ✅  
3. Product ↔ last receipt link — high ✅  
4. Lot management UI (ops + audit) — high; read-only list ✅, ops later  
5. Inventory as ADJUSTMENT — critical ✅ (`POST /pharmacy/inventories` → store_stock + lots + `stock_movements`)  
6. Audit journal surface — next (`stock_movements` by product)  

